    "detailed_description": "<h1>Create your own Mods</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751780/extras/af0259406bcf2ff5b1d3438ea1607e93.avif?t=1699372258\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Forager</strong> is a 2D open world game inspired by exploration, farming and crafting games such as Stardew Valley, Terraria &amp; Zelda.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gather, collect and manage resources.<br></li><li> Craft useful items &amp; structures.<br></li><li> Build and grow a base out of nothing. Buy land to expand and explore.<br></li><li> Level up and learn new skills, abilities, and blueprints.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles, find secrets and raid dungeons!<br></li><li> Achieve anything you want! The choice is yours, you set your own goals to work towards!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751780/extras/26ab220d25cd88d361334361dbd74471.poster.avif?t=1699372258\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751780/extras/26ab220d25cd88d361334361dbd74471.webm?t=1699372258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751780/extras/26ab220d25cd88d361334361dbd74471.mp4?t=1699372258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Start small and improve your base, skills, equipment, network of friends (and enemies!) and build your future as you see fit! You can play Forager in a very varied array of playstyles...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME... A GATHERER</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751780/extras/aa1468841d26c04a801c992024f9fe89.avif?t=1699372258\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME... A FARMER</strong></h2><div class